@startuml cu75
!theme plain
title CU75 — Generar Minuta de Inscripción

actor "Escribano" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) requests generation of the registration memorandum.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Loads the deed data and the parties.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) checks the registry data.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Validates that the fields are complete.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) confirms generation.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Generates the official memorandum document.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) submits the testimony and the memorandum.
System -> System : Clerk
Actor -> Actor : Records the filing date and entry number.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The registry authority processes it and returns it.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The clerk (Gestor) records the receipt date and registration.
System -> System : Clerk

@enduml